            "review_title": "Review at Starbucks Coffee",
            "review_text": "Anh Tran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam61 contributions\n0\nAlways a favorite\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI always come back to Starbucks. My friends from oversea said that the concept of Starbucks in Vietnam is way too extra, and I am just a happy customer I just dont care, it’s about the concept. \nI’ve been to Starbucks Nguyen Du, Starbucks near Rex Hotel, Starbucks on Nguyen Hue Street, the new one in Vincom Center and the one on Nguyen Van Troi Street. All their staffs are very well-trained and polite. They did everything they can to replace the normal milk to low fat milk and reduce the sugar level in my drink for me. They take care of the cake I choose before giving it to me and they ask me about my day. \n\nTheir people are just lovely and I am just a happy customer :)\nRead more\nWritten August 14, 2018",
