            "review_text": "Kerrivv\nMooloolaba, Australia175 contributions\n0\nComfort Coffee\nMar 2018 • Business\nLike most westerners I have a brief moment in my travels when I need to have something familiar and pretend that I am home for about 5 minutes. Starbucks is the place. The menu is the same world wide, the internet is free and the snacks are the same everywhere in the world. I have taken shelter here as well as Starbucks in Singapore, China, Thailand and I can say I feel as if I am in little Starbucks land in the middle of no mans land. Worth going in for time out and revive back on your feet.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 10, 2018",
