            "review_text": "Nan F\nStamford, Connecticut342 contributions\n0\nSafe ice, good coffee, lots of seating\nJan 2018 • Couples\nSafe ice is a big draw in a city where you have to be careful of the water. Like many of the Starbuck locations in Ho Chi Min City, there is ample seating and a nice, low-key vibe. Sandwiches and sweets are a little different here than in the U.S. but pretty recognizable, such as a chicken sandwich on a pumpernickel bun. Located near shopping and hotels.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 31, 2018",
